{{!--
    A CMS-managed call to action, from /leed:create cta (site-patterns rule 3). Dynamic CTAs are a
    Growth feature. Leed chooses the CTA by page type and label, serves it live and appends it into
    this element, so editing it in the CMS changes the site without a republish. When none matches,
    the element stays empty.

    Use: {{> cta }\} in a layout or a pass-through page. Never the CTA helper, which is deprecated.
--}}
<section data-leed-cta class="site-cta"></section>
